{
"file": 29,
"paths": [
"d002/f637"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "2d5b9a91",
"en_raw": "At dusk, in front of the Sakaue Jizo"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "76f8fe4d",
"en_raw": "close your eyes..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "74d4b6c9",
"en_raw": "When you sense someone, turn around"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "974238ec",
"en_raw": "If you turn from the right"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "9a3ea349",
"en_raw": "you'll meet the one you'll marry..."
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "c50cd0ea",
"en_raw": "If you turn from the left"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "482608f8",
"en_raw": "you meet your future self, they say"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "9d3e82bc",
"en_raw": "Oh, is that so?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "8a1a5c06",
"en_raw": "Don't say 'I see'"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "f9946930",
"en_raw": "There's no way that's real"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "9fdee6d2",
"en_raw": "But Nishi came, didn't he?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "ec21ebcd",
"en_raw": "That's just a coincidence..."
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "dec52314",
"en_raw": "...I thought, but no"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "19e4274c",
"en_raw": "That fake psychic girl"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "dd8ad143",
"en_raw": "must have arranged it all"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "a2bcebc3",
"en_raw": "Hey Nao, can't we ask Takayuki Nishi"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "bf7bcdf5",
"en_raw": "about that stuff?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "b4949b8d",
"en_raw": "No way we can ask"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "4d86ed88",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "456bfddd",
"en_raw": "But why don't we try it ourselves"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "eb1f9e5c",
"en_raw": "and see if"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "5a95bd69",
"en_raw": "the fortune is true?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "924db628",
"en_raw": "...Seriously?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "db342d53",
"en_raw": "The Sakaue Jizo is at the top of the"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "4aefa897",
"en_raw": "station stairs, you mean"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "762e5c37",
"en_raw": "that Jizo statue, right?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "f1af67bf",
"en_raw": "I'm not going along with this"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "3e2d9470",
"en_raw": "that's"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "47361911",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao, so in the end"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "05c76ff7",
"en_raw": "how was that fortune?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "3c618d1e",
"en_raw": "I don't really get it, but"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "f636f5da",
"en_raw": "I met an old man..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "b5e9f23a",
"en_raw": "Was that future Nao?"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "fe479efa",
"en_raw": "I can't tell that"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "2193a0ea",
"en_raw": "You should have asked his name"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "b8825531",
"en_raw": "...No"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "4d956493",
"en_raw": "I'm glad I didn't ask"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "9d7dfeab",
"en_raw": "You were scared, weren't you?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a98cdb3a",
"en_raw": "Don't worry about it"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "3b1fd153",
"en_raw": "It's just a coincidence"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "d8b55aea",
"en_raw": "But I really did meet him"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "05315fa6",
"en_raw": "Maybe I'll try it"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "a12cf7ea",
"en_raw": "...Hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "aeb1ba63",
"en_raw": "...Hm? Oh, I'm listening"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "c39c7efb",
"en_raw": "...What?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "d704b791",
"en_raw": "So, in the end"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "8b3a5865",
"en_raw": "how was that thing"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "9bde1aa1",
"en_raw": "...What thing?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "970dff31",
"en_raw": "...The Sakaue Jizo fortune"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "4d414a4d",
"en_raw": "Oh, that"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "14b58c12",
"en_raw": "In the end, I"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "ab04c29b",
"en_raw": "didn't do it"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "e93253d8",
"en_raw": "I don't want to know"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "a06956af",
"en_raw": "about my future yet"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "83a6a885",
"en_raw": "...Hmm, oh well"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "5c2b08d5",
"en_raw": "If you're that curious"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "fe41c042",
"en_raw": "why don't you try it, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "6d3420f8",
"en_raw": "Kurumi, the Jizo fortune"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "94680d56",
"en_raw": "made me sad..."
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "062458d6",
"en_raw": "Hey, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "c2308521",
"en_raw": "Why not try it once more?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "88cfdb81",
"en_raw": "You might get a different result"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "1f473a4b",
"en_raw": "you know"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "0e9642e8",
"en_raw": "Right, Nao"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "6ded33cf",
"en_raw": "you're the one who should go"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "4846f194",
"en_raw": "But that's"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "2cb69e71",
"en_raw": "not a fortune, is it?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "df4e2626",
"en_raw": "Kurumi won't do it again"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "47ae33b1",
"en_raw": "Too bad"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "4175302e",
"en_raw": "Then, Sango"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "ac56a315",
"en_raw": "what do we do?"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "71941547",
"en_raw": "To confirm the facts"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "da62b7b3",
"en_raw": "the more examples the better"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "34519840",
"en_raw": "...Right"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "68625396",
"en_raw": "I'll try it too"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "78fd6cb2",
"en_raw": "So how was it for Sango, in the end?"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "09d1951d",
"en_raw": "No, actually, after that"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "3b5bbaa1",
"en_raw": "I went home"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "02fd55af",
"en_raw": "It got stupid partway through"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "1255d56a",
"en_raw": "...Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "669977a6",
"en_raw": "a fortune like that"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "92ec657e",
"en_raw": "has no basis, right?"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "554011c8",
"en_raw": "Right, it's the same old"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "6c46e923",
"en_raw": "Toilet Gang tall tale"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "7436e295",
"en_raw": "Then I won't believe it either"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "fbf95307",
"en_raw": "I mean"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "9f378122",
"en_raw": "you decide your own future, right?"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "de7c5cdf",
"en_raw": "Fortune-telling is nonsense"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "31f0b2f2",
"en_raw": "to begin with"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "d2f41d2f",
"en_raw": "...Aren't you?"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "01ab066c",
"en_raw": "Yeah, that's right"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "48c321b1",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Sakaue Jizo"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "69bb6252",
"en_raw": "The truth about Toilet Gang's Sakai and"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "1aa2184e",
"en_raw": "Takayuki Nishi is unknown"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "a161e29f",
"en_raw": "Still, somehow"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "739089bf",
"en_raw": "the Sakaue Jizo has become"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "6eaf27f1",
"en_raw": "a confession spot"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "124effe7",
"en_raw": "probably, surely"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "71a6af80",
"en_raw": "because of those guys..."
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "0734d10e",
"en_raw": "Well, it's fine, though"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}